* sample.a4 -- a 6804 program for as4.  The 6804 has a very small* instruction set: no CLR on the pseudo-registers, no CMP immediate.* See DOC/xasm/asm.doc, which lists what each assembler accepts.*        org     $0020start   lda     #$05        sta     $80        lda     #$00        sta     $81loop    inc     $81        lda     $81        bne     loop        jmp     start        end